  "note": "Inputs of world_economy.py that cannot be derived: the security doctrine of each polity (why it pays for armed forces, written from its history in world.json), the split of Sol's population over bodies, and the standard asset / ship-task constants. Everything numeric about defence (share of output, ships, bases) is DERIVED from these doctrines plus data (relations, beacons, habitats, trade); the shares are not typed in.",
